The '''fifteenth series''' of ''[[The Great British Bake Off]]'' began on 24 September 2024. [[Alison Hammond]] and [[Noel Fielding]] returned as hosts, with [[Paul Hollywood]] and [[Prue Leith]] returning to judge the series. The bakers competing in the series were announced on 17 September 2024.<ref>{{cite web |title=Great British Bake Off 2024: Meet all 12 contestants in this year's competition |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/tv/news/great-british-bake-off-2024-contestants-b2614078.html |website=[[The Independent]] |access-date=24 September 2024 |language=en |date=17 September 2024}}</ref>

The series was won by Georgie Grasso, with [[Dylan Bachelet]] and Christiaan de Vries finishing as the runners-up.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Instagram |url=https://www.instagram.com/reel/DC2XHw_AZCF/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link |access-date=2024-11-27 |website=www.instagram.com}}</ref>

