== Episodes ==

=== Episode 1: Cake ===
The first episode is Cake Week.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Gilbert |first1=Gerard |title=On TV tonight, Bake Off 2024 kicks off with cake week |url=https://inews.co.uk/culture/television/whats-on-tv-tonight-sept-24-3291064?srsltid=AfmBOoojLQbwrYSY69TUaouuXYE-NQin_ArJT-_LYb-H-StlwF6HTcA8 |website=[[i (newspaper)|i]] |access-date=24 September 2024 |language=en |date=24 September 2024}}</ref> For the first challenge, the bakers were given two hours to produce an elevated version of their signature loaf cake. For the technical challenge, set by Paul, the bakers were asked to bake a batch of eight perfectly symmetrical mini [[Battenberg cake]]s, consisting of a light sponge sandwiched in a silky buttercream, coated in apricot jam and wrapped in marzipan. The bakers were given five minutes to inspect and taste a mini Battenburg cake with no additional recipe, and were then given two hours and fifteen minutes to complete the challenge. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were asked to make a hyper-realistic illusion cake in four hours. 
